1
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,950
Sunday morning. The whole city is still blue.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,879
Then the bakery opens, and the day gets its first color.

3
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:25,365
The park adds pink. And, apparently, a passenger.

4
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,172
By the river, every color overlaps.

5
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:36,000
Same ride every Sunday. Never quite the same print.
